#Overview
This Program Uses the Monte Carlo simulation to calculate the Value of PI

We are doing to test multi threading to see the diffence in time when running the program using 
differnt number of treads.

# What you need
gcc Compiler

#Resorces
For help with pthreads_join to wait for the threads to finish excuting I used the 
OpenGroud.org pthread_join page.(https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/009695399/functions/pthread_join.html)

I used the Code from week 3 Lecture 6 in my program as the boiler plate code for my project and
for help with the basics of pthreads and pthread mutexes.


